 "deviations": "- Kit experience audit/harness/robodojo_physics_only.kit instead of isaaclab.python.kit (no RTX, replicator, camera or\n  viewport extensions); AppLauncher is bypassed and its carb settings are set as evaluation sets them, except that\n  cameras and the offscreen flag are off (offscreen needs the viewport extension); evaluation's PARTIAL_RENDERING\n  render() (forward, then app.update with playSimulations off) is reproduced by patching SimulationContext.render;\n  evaluation's zero-delay render args and camera extensions are not added.\n- sys.modules stubs: CameraManager and TiledCaptureManager (null; reset keeps the per-env reseeding and the one\n  sim_step), create_mdl_material (USD-only Material + Shader, no physics API), WsModelClient (no-op),\n  CuroboPlanner (need_planner false; joint actions never use it), and the policy module (a local scripted policy).\n- `env`, `task` and `utils` are pinned to the repository (namespace packages that Kit's own `utils` shadows).\n- Assets: table and ground MDL files are empty placeholders (visual only); wrist and head camera prims are not created.",
 "eval_carb_differences": {
  "/isaaclab/render/offscreen": {
   "eval": true,
   "harness": false
  },
  "/isaaclab/cameras_enabled": {
   "eval": true,
   "harness": false
  }
 },
